Let me add another nice solution from the official solution: :P 
Note  $f(x)=x\log x$  is convex. The key step: weighted Popoviciu gives \[bf(a)+cf(b)+af(c)+(a+b+c)f\left(\frac{bc+ca+ab}{a+b+c}\right)\ge \sum_{cyc} (b+c)f\left(\frac{ab+bc}{b+c}\right).\] Exponentiating gives 
\begin{align*}
a^{bc}\cdot b^{ca}\cdot c^{ab} \cdot \left(\frac{bc+ca+ab}{a+b+c}\right)^{bc+ca+ab}&\ge \prod_{cyc} \left(\frac{b(a+c)}{b+c}\right)^{bc+ab}  &=\prod_{cyc} a^{ab+ca}(b+c)^{ab+ca-bc-ab}
\end{align*}
Cancelling some terms and using  $\frac{bc+ca+ab}{a+b+c}=1$  gives \[1\ge \prod_{cyc} a^{ca}(a+b)^{bc-ab}\] which rearranges to the result.  $\quad \blacksquare$

