Thus, we have a chain of inequalities of the form
\begin{align*}
&ka_k - S_k < a_0 \leq ka_{k+1}-S_k
&(k+1)a_{k+1} - S_{k+1} < a_0 \leq (k+1)a_{k+2}-S_{k+1}
& \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \vdots
&la_l - S_l < a_0 \leq la_{l+1}-S_l
