=& BH^2-HM'\cdot HB=BH^2-HX'\cdot HX
=& BH^2-(HA-X'A')(HA+XA')=BH^2-HA^2+XA'^2\qquad\text{[Since }X'A'=XA']
=& BA'^2+XA'^2
